{"title":"Career Roadmap · Legal Aid Counsel","role":"Legal Aid Counsel","summary":"A Legal Aid Counsel provides legal assistance to people who may have limited access to legal representation because of financial, social or other barriers.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law - LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Human Rights Law"},"about":[],"intro":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What happened?"},{"text":"When?"},{"text":"Where?"},{"text":"Who was involved?"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Affected Right","Applicable Constitutional / Statutory Protection","Violation","Evidence","Responsible Authority / Party","Available Remedy","Legal Action"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Legal Issue","Applicable Law","Violation / Ground","Evidence","Arguments","Relief Requested"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Rights Involved","Applicable Law","Evidence","Legal Arguments","Remedy","Court Decision","Impact"]}],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Legal Aid Counsel provides legal assistance to people who may have limited access to legal representation because of financial, social or other barriers."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Human rights law"},{"text":"Constitutional law"},{"text":"Criminal law"},{"text":"Civil law"},{"text":"Legal aid"},{"text":"Access to justice"},{"text":"Legal research"},{"text":"Litigation"},{"text":"Client counselling"},{"text":"Community legal awareness"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Legal Aid Counsel may work through:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Legal Services Authorities"},{"text":"Legal aid clinics"},{"text":"NGOs"},{"text":"Law firms with pro-bono practices"},{"text":"Human-rights organizations"},{"text":"Prison/legal assistance programs"},{"text":"Child and women's rights organizations"},{"text":"Community legal programs"},{"text":"Independent legal practices"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The role is particularly relevant to issues involving underrepresented or vulnerable communities, but the exact eligibility and appointment pathway depends on the organization and applicable legal framework."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["LL.B.","Human Rights + Legal Aid Foundation","Legal Aid Clinic / NGO Internship","Legal Intern / Legal Aid Volunteer","Junior Legal Aid Counsel / Legal Associate","Legal Aid Counsel","Senior Legal Aid Counsel","Legal Services / Human Rights Specialist","Legal Aid Program Lead / Human Rights Lawyer"]},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative Path"},{"type":"flow","items":["Legal Aid","Human Rights Litigation","Public Interest Litigation","Constitutional Law Practice","Human Rights Legal Specialist"]}]},{"heading":"What a Legal Aid Counsel Does","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Client intake"},{"text":"Legal counselling"},{"text":"Case assessment"},{"text":"Legal research"},{"text":"Drafting applications"},{"text":"Preparing petitions"},{"text":"Representing eligible clients where authorized"},{"text":"Court filing"},{"text":"Bail and criminal-law assistance"},{"text":"Family-law support"},{"text":"Labour-law assistance"},{"text":"Domestic-violence-related legal support"},{"text":"Child-rights matters"},{"text":"Prisoner legal assistance"},{"text":"Government-scheme awareness"},{"text":"Referral to appropriate services"},{"text":"Community legal education"},{"text":"The counsel's objective is not simply to \"win cases\", but to help clients understand and effectively exercise their legal rights."}]}]},{"heading":"Core Areas of Law","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Legal Aid Counsel should build broad legal knowledge."},{"type":"table","header":["Area","Importance"],"rows":[[{"text":"Constitutional Law"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Criminal Law"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Criminal Procedure"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Evidence"},{"tex